# Find The Needle, Turkish.
#
# An empty msgstr is not a bug: it means the string falls back to its message
# id, which is the English source text. See docs/localization/PLAN.md.
#
# Turkish keeps a noun singular after a number ("5 balya"), so both plural
# forms are usually the same words. The header still carries two, which is
# what gettext writes for Turkish: msgstr[0] for 1, msgstr[1] for the rest.
#
# Capitals: dotted i goes to İ, dotless ı goes to I. Write "İPTAL", never
# "IPTAL". Anything the code capitalises at run time goes through Cfg.upper.
#
# To bring this file up to date after the English has moved:
#     python scripts/dev/gen_pot.py --merge tr
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Find The Needle\n"
"Language: tr\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

msgid "SMALL"
msgstr "KÜÇÜK"

msgid "Designed for weaker computers. A shorter hunt with room to walk around the pile."
msgstr "Zayıf bilgisayarlar için. Daha kısa bir arama, yığının çevresinde dolaşacak yer de var."

msgid "STANDARD"
msgstr "STANDART"

msgid "The yard as it comes. The pile the game was built around, under one steel roof."
msgstr "Bildiğin bahçe. Oyunun asıl yığını, tek bir çelik çatının altında."

msgid "BIG"
msgstr "BÜYÜK"

msgid "Twice the hay and a crown that stands over the wall plates. Bring a belt."
msgstr "İki kat saman ve duvarların üstüne taşan bir tepe. Bant lazım olacak."

msgid "HUGE"
msgstr "DEV"

msgid "Eight storeys of straw. The shed goes out to meet it and the roof still loses. Slow to load."
msgstr "Sekiz kat saman. Ambar da büyüyor ama çatı yine yetmiyor. Geç yüklenir."

msgid "THE MOUNTAIN"
msgstr "DAĞ"

msgid "Fifty metres. It does not fit under the roof, it is not supposed to, and you will not finish it. Takes a minute to pour."
msgstr "Elli metre. Çatının altına sığmıyor, sığması da gerekmiyor, zaten bitiremeyeceksin. Dökülmesi bir dakika sürer."

